<title>THAILAND: Thai Sept C/A deficit widens to 30.5 bln baht.</title>
<headline>Thai Sept C/A deficit widens to 30.5 bln baht.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's September current account deficit widened to a preliminary 30.5 billion baht from 29.3 billion baht deficit in August, the Bank of Thailand said on Thursday.</p>
<p>    C/A DEFICIT	   Sept 96	Aug 96	Sept 95</p>
<p>				 30.5	   29.3	   17.0</p>
<p>Note - Figures in billions of baht. August figure was revised.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
